id=pico4_swift_force_enable
name=PICO 4 Motion Tracker Unlock (2.0.5)
version=v2.7
versionCode=12
author=wzy
description=PICO 4 Motion Tracker 2.0.5 unlock for PICO 4 standard (ROM 5.13.x). v2.7 single build: STOCK scheduling only (no CPU tuning - performance tuning moved to the pico4-power-mode project). Auto-restores properties left by old performance flavors. Includes tracker detection fix (native compat shim) and reliable install/upgrade/uninstall (PackageManager cache handling). Stock APK, systemless. Requires root (Magisk). Reboot after install.
